
                       geant4-11-02-ref-03
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Updated GDML schema to version 3.1.7.
 o Updates to cross-section classes to rationalise initialisation of data
   in MT mode.
 o Fixes to allow compilation on Windows when using Qt6.
 o Ported Vtk driver to compile and run on Windows.
 o Updated dataset G4PARTICLEXS-4.1.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(*)  Fixes included in patch release 11.2.2

Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

cmake                                            cmake-V11-02-06
-----
- Updated FindPythia6 module to account for lib64.                           (*)
  Applies GitHub PR#63 (https://github.com/Geant4/geant4/pull/63).
- Updated FindPythia8 module to reduce capability to only that required by   (*)
  py8decayer example and emit error if used in project outside Geant4 or
  py8decayer. Applies GitHub PR#68 (https://github.com/Geant4/geant4/pull/68). 
- Fixed escaping of regex in geant4_module_check to satisfy latest Python3.  (*)
- Updated dataset G4PARTICLEXS-4.1.

externals/g4tools                                g4tools-V11-02-01
